WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.832 --> 00:00:03.306
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> It often <b>snows</b> here in winter.

2
00:00:03.675 --> 00:00:05.708
Look! It<b>’s snowing</b>.

3
00:00:06.921 --> 00:00:09.287
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> What <b>do you</b> usually <b>do</b> at work?

4
00:00:10.072 --> 00:00:11.594
What <b>are you doing</b> now?

5
00:00:12.474 --> 00:00:14.817
<v><b>Speaker 3:</b></v> My sister <b>works</b> in a bank.

6
00:00:15.376 --> 00:00:17.552
Today she<b>’s working</b> at home.